---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How It Started"
  description="The origin story of Killington Getaway — from a bad restaurant recommendation to the most trusted local guide in Vermont ski country."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white font-body">
    <Hero
      title='<span class="text-white">How It</span> <span class="text-brand-green">Started</span>'
      subtitle="The Origin Story"
      image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500595046743-cd271d694d30?w=1600&q=80"
    />

    <!-- Article content -->
    <article class="py-24 px-6 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-black text-brand-navy leading-relaxed mb-16 tracking-tight">
          It started with a bad recommendation. Someone told a first-time visitor to Killington to try a restaurant that had been closed for two years. That single moment of frustration eventually became Killington Getaway.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 text-gray-400 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-black text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-tight">The Problem with <span class="text-brand-green">Guides</span></h2>
              <p>
                If you've ever searched for "best restaurants in Killington" or "where to stay near Killington ski resort," you've seen the problem. The results are full of articles written by people who visited once in 2018, listicles generated by algorithms, and reviews that are years out of date.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
              <p>
                Ski towns have a particular problem with this. The turnover is high, seasons are compressed, and the people who actually know the mountain — the instructors, the patrol, the lift operators — aren't usually the ones writing guides.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="h-[1px] bg-gray-100 my-8"></div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-black text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-tight">A Local's <span class="text-brand-green">Frustration</span></h2>
              <p>
                Jonas, one of the co-founders of Killington Getaway, had been skiing Killington for over a decade when he started getting texts from friends visiting for ski weekends. "Where should we stay?" "Where do locals eat?"
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
              <p>
                He knew which condo complexes were ski-in/ski-out and which ones weren't. He knew which restaurants had the best happy hour deals. He knew that the best mountain lunch was a sandwich from the Killington Deli, not the overpriced slope-side options.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pull quote -->
          <blockquote class="my-16 relative p-12 bg-gray-50 rounded-[3rem] border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-brand-green"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-black text-brand-navy leading-tight mb-6 italic">
                "We answer the question: what would a local tell you if you texted them right now?"
              </p>
              <cite class="text-[10px] font-black text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-widest not-italic flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-gray-200"></span>
                Killington Getaway, Founding Principle
              </cite>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-black text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-tight">Building the <span class="text-brand-green">Guide</span></h2>
              <p>
                The first version of Killington Getaway was launched with a simple premise: every listing had to be verified by someone who had actually been there recently. No SEO-farm content. No paid placements.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
              <p>
                The team grew organically. Other Killington locals — Marc, Jorge, Paul, John — joined to cover the areas they knew best. The summer guide was written by people who hiked the trails every July. The apres guide was written by people who close the Pickle Barrel on Saturdays.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="h-[1px] bg-gray-100 my-8"></div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-black text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-tight">Where We Are <span class="text-brand-green">Today</span></h2>
              <p>
                Killington Getaway is now the most comprehensive independent guide to the Killington region. We cover lodging, dining, activities, gear shops, mountain conditions, and everything in between.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
              <p>
                We're a Certified B Corporation, which means we've passed an independent audit confirming our commitment to social and environmental impact. A percentage of our revenue goes directly to YES (Youth Enrichment Services).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="py-24 px-6 text-center bg-gray-50/50 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-brand-navy rounded-[4rem] py-16 px-10 border border-brand-navy shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-green/10 rounded-full -mr-32 -mt-32"></div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-black text-white mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase relative z-10">Read More <span class="text-brand-green">About Us</span></h2>
        <div class="flex gap-6 justify-center flex-wrap relative z-10 mt-12">
          <a href="/our-story" class="bg-brand-green text-white font-black px-12 py-5 rounded-full hover:bg-brand-green/90 transition-all shadow-xl uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
            Our Story
          </a>
          <a href="/our-team" class="bg-white text-brand-navy font-black px-12 py-5 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100 transition-all shadow-xl uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
            Meet the Team
          </a>
          <a href="/giving-back" class="bg-transparent text-white border-2 border-white/20 font-black px-12 py-5 rounded-full hover:bg-white/5 transition-all uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
            Giving Back
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
